Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：在球形场地中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和特隆展开了一场势均力敌的较量。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与星光体之间的奇迹之力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连泽阿尔也对他不起作用！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这场决斗我可绝对不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了，我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)我承认你确实厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还以为你逃不掉了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能躲过刚才那一击……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，那就是你们的必杀技吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破了压箱底必杀技的你们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经毫无胜算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我身上承载着大家托付给我的心意！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在把它交到你手上之前绝对不放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会从你那里得到什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:01:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你们的最后了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 纹章兽·纹章鹰 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用从希望皇 霍普雷夺取的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 纹章兽·纹章鹰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升500点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷的攻击力下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用希望皇 霍普雷的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你们消灭掉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽·纹章鹰！ 攻击希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之愤怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 半不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合的战斗中不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗产生的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:01:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)你的剩余生命已经只剩50了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个难缠的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值还没耗尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着你那不服输的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我想起了 一马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个令人火大的一马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢小看父亲我绝不原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.53,0:02:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)冷静点 游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 刚才那次攻击已经让我看到了胜利的方程式。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆) 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你该不会因为 宫廷之臂的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元没了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就觉得这样能赢吧你没这么想吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动纹章兽 双头鹰的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地里的这只怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把「纹章兽·双头鹰」的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材复活两个！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也差不多该放弃了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)3800对50吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.75,0:03:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负已分了吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)到头来 游马他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是会输掉吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊…… 这下真的……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 游马？ 没事吧？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 肚子……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肚子饿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊这种时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是……肚子饿了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((吃那个 绝对要赢哦))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个这个！ 从小鸟那里拿到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……在干什么啊乌啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 难道把决斗给放弃了吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:05:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小猫咪)怎么会这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马才没有放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 游马！ 上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵……真是服了。决斗中居然吃饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 这种感觉是。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊你 是第一次吃饭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是所谓的吃饭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 肚子饿了的话可是没法战斗的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不可思议。从身体深处再次涌出了斗志。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是活着的实感。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 说不定随时都会消失就在这一瞬间 这种感觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 和你在一起真是有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决斗吧！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还想 吃更多的 决斗饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大碗的两份！ 不 三份！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我想更多地感受活着这件事！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个劲头！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 已经胜利的方程式已经齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的光啊 力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我的右臂再次 照亮希望的道路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终·闪耀·抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等的就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡 装备到希望皇身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！异热同心武器·雷神猛虎剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？异热同心武器 二刀流？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了雷神猛虎剑的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇的攻击力 上升1300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 5000！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 雷神猛虎剑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为装备卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽不能成为破坏的对象！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 闪电之刃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成装备卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的魔法 陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能成为破坏的对象！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 两边都没法被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么… 用泽阿尔·武器的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}互相作用的效果的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铠甲之衣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏卡片的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就无法发动了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。 这正是这二刀流的战术无敌！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！ 波普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击铠甲之衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:09:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}波普剑 双重·混沌·斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱 发动！ 爆裂·梅达利翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在战斗中 把你的泽阿尔·武器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部返回手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以结束战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…怎么会！超量武器竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还有由于爆裂·流星的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一张回到手牌的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予你们500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的战斗已经结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的 只要回合结束就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 是你们输了游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此我也 绝不放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不想放弃!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得好 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 这种情况下你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子 没有根据吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 没有必要放弃这件事你说对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太难看了，星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的战斗已经结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我应该说过。已经
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完成了胜利的方程式！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 异热同心武器·天马双翼剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤1只异热同心武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，闪电之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做无用功！你忘了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动宫廷的规矩的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽效果无效
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并吸收那个效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间墓地里的孤挺花的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}墓地？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将墓地中的阿玛莉莉丝除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高等召唤所需的怪兽１只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以减少！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 龙卷风·闪焰者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我说过 那是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铠甲外套的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多隆)将龙卷风·闪焰者的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果夺过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来２只异热同心武器的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果就被吸收了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了 已经没胜算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了乌拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过是徒劳的挣扎罢了游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙卷风·闪焰者与
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪电之刃的等级 ２只都是５。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来条件就齐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 用２只异热同心武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个没想到 特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级5的闪电之刃和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}角龙冲角 超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只谢尔武器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 谢尔武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮鹫臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢尔武器的怪兽超量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在希望皇在场时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为其装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升3000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这个效果不会被无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斗士披挂的 那件战衣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰鸣的咆哮 撼动大地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迸射的迅雷连神也能击碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兽装合体 狮鹫希望皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力5500 这样的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你忘了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那个回合的攻击已经结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动狮子武装的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮子武装在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束之后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能再一次 进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１个回合竟然能进行２次战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 究极的泽阿尔武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 泽阿尔武器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为合为一体了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相互生效的无敌效果应该已经消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(托隆)发动盾徽的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是 盾徽真正的姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对手场地上存在的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏１张！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把霍普雷 咬碎吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮臂的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.49,0:14:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将其攻击力减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.85,0:14:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！狮跃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 三重混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！游马赢了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了～！泽阿尔乌拉赢了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好啊乌拉～泽阿尔乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)九十九游马赢了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一届 世界决斗狂欢节
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}优胜者是 九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)拜隆竟然败了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过无论哪边赢 都无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 就在这里 No.们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我来回收了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.63,0:16:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们…!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞 费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.15,0:16:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！游马～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.41,0:17:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的 拜隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了 No.的你 力量什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就那样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧 拜隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)我可要燃起来了 我！))
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！这到底是怎么回事啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 星光…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球形场地是用来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把所有 No.卡回收的场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗嘉年华中收集到的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会在决赛中集结。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个绝佳的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡不可能会放过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这个场地从一开始就是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 那家伙等着我们战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着 No.卡的力量变强。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放开手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个场地里我是异物。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去你们也会。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 不要 我… 我绝不放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 为什么要救我？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗过之后就是同伴了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.11,0:19:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些复杂的事情我虽然不太懂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗会为同伴……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}建立起羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 只要决斗过了你也是我的同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在终于明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么不放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来就在我复仇的前方啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……我没能像一马和你那样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……我不会让一切
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都任由菲卡摆布。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我捕获的灵魂全部解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永别了…游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：父亲大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：父亲大人))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原谅我吧 各位。这次我不会再忘记 那段时光》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})我们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:20:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})哥哥大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.89,0:21:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马！》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡) 我一直在等这一刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 来做最后的收尾吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭星光体世界的最后收尾。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.10,0:23:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.03,0:23:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.23,0:23:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.81,0:24:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.33,0:24:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的热尔武器好厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊，既然叫泽阿尔·武器{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.45,0:24:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那迟早泽阿尔·下·武器也会出来吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.70,0:24:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来的话就好了，泽阿尔·横·武器也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.06,0:24:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有那种东西啊！好激动！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.45,0:24:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不行啊。

